{
  "_about": "Per-country channel priorities for the hotel-deal-finder. There is NO universal cheapest booking site — the lowest final price depends on country, hotel, dates, and stacked loyalty/cashback (Forbes/Frommer's/Upgraded Points 2026). So this file lists which channels to CHECK FIRST per country, ordered by local strength, not a single 'winner'. Each channel is tagged with the cascade tier and whether a browserless tool exists yet (implemented) or it is a recommended manual/keyed check.",
  "_sources": [
    { "title": "Mize — OTA market share across the world", "url": "https://mize.tech/blog/online-travel-agencies-market-share-across-the-world/" },
    { "title": "EHL Insights — Hotel OTAs (regional leaders)", "url": "https://insights.ehl.edu/hotel-otas" },
